  <body>
    <sec>
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <p>Enterprise data contains hidden graph-like structure across tables, APIs, logs, and documents.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec>
      <title>Method</title>
      <p>The method preserves evidence, validates candidates, and materializes property graph and RDF outputs.</p>
    </sec>
